  "description": "The NCDK chemistry engine for MolDraw.Net: turns SMILES, MOL and SDF input into clean 2D depictions — layout, aromaticity, ring-aware double bonds, wedge/hash stereo and implicit hydrogens. Atom indices follow the input (RDKit-compatible heavy-atom order), so per-atom model output lines up. Registers IChemistryEngine via AddMolDrawCore(); depends on NCDK (LGPL-2.1).",
